 celebrated the meeting, and many exchanged gifts and took photographs together. However, the formal alliance between the Soviet Union and the United States began to deteriorate soon after the end of the war.","LocalizedString":"The Soviet army and the US army met at the River Elbe in Germany on April 25, 1945, towards the end of WWII in Europe. The meeting of the Allied forces, known as Elbe Day, was significant as it effectively split Germany in half and signaled the near-end of the war in Europe. The Soviet and American soldiers celebrated the meeting, and many exchanged gifts and took photographs together. However, the formal alliance between the Soviet Union and the United States began to deteriorate soon after the end of the war."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::BrothersInArms","isReserved":true,"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'October_Red'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/OrdersFeb17/October_Red.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Soviet/Spring2023Candidates/t_stand_together.t_stand_together","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Soviet WWII Poster","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/STAND_TOGETHER.STAND_TOGETHER","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":385.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_event_stand_together_brothers_photo","SourceString":"Soviet and American troops shaking hands on Elb Day, April 25, 1945.","LocalizedString":"Soviet and American troops shaking hands on Elb Day, April 25, 1945."},"isAttackBuff":true,"isDefenseBuff":true},"variables":[{"name":"frontline","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"cardToSpawn","type":"FName","direction":"in"},{"name":"hasUnitToSpawn","type":"TMap<int32,bool>","direction":"in"}],"functions":[{"name":"CanPlayFromHand","owner":"card_event_stand_together_brothers_C","params":[{"name":"canIt","type":"bool","direction":"out"},{"name":"